      "name": "[Dialyn] Deathrattle Toll",
      "desc": "When Dialyn has 90 <color=#FFFFFF>Positive Reviews</color> points, using <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Get Lost!</color> will consume 90 <color=#FFFFFF>Positive Reviews</color> and directly replace it with <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate: Service Stopped for Number Dialed</color>. When <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate: Service Stopped for Number Dialed</color> hits a Stunned enemy, it will <color=#2BAD00>trigger the Totalize effect, dealing additional DMG equal to 2,700% of Dialyn's ATK</color>, and <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate: Service Stopped for Number Dialed</color>'s <color=#2BAD00>DMG will increase by 30%</color>.",
